00:26:12.790 --> 00:26:16.550
Council members Meredith and Watkins asked what the city pays them for and

00:26:16.550 --> 00:26:20.430
we're told that it is the background check system for new hires and alcohol

00:26:20.430 --> 00:26:25.630
licenses, and that is that it is not related to camera systems in any way.

00:26:25.990 --> 00:26:27.920
We almost had a motion to vote on it separately,

00:26:28.110 --> 00:26:30.600
but that was drawn, uh, withdrawn after that answer.

00:26:31.410 --> 00:26:35.100
Um, but if the city already has 2 contracts for background checks,

00:26:35.450 --> 00:26:38.510
then what is LexisNexis even for?

00:26:38.650 --> 00:26:43.600
Um, I read the LexisNexis contract, and the city agreed that it will not

00:26:43.610 --> 00:26:44.850
use it for employment.

00:26:45.250 --> 00:26:49.120
Or for government license decisions to do that they would have to sign a

00:26:49.120 --> 00:26:52.410
separate addendum and there's none that it that the city has posted.

00:26:52.680 --> 00:26:57.040
In fact, the city's own memo for LexisNexis says it is for conducting active

00:26:57.040 --> 00:27:00.760
criminal investigations and it is related to cameras.

00:27:01.040 --> 00:27:06.000
The company's quote to HPD lists five interfaces that feed into the system,

00:27:06.200 --> 00:27:08.820
and one of them is LPRs, license plate readers.

00:27:09.800 --> 00:27:13.720
Another concerning fact is that this contract also says that the city will

00:27:13.720 --> 00:27:17.310
not name LexisNexis or refer to its use.

00:27:17.920 --> 00:27:20.450
More concerning is that it isn't the only one.

00:27:20.680 --> 00:27:23.560
The city's 2020 agreement with the Huntsville Utilities or police camera

00:27:23.580 --> 00:27:26.650
network says the information about it shall not be disseminated,

00:27:26.720 --> 00:27:30.440
disclosed, or commented on publicly without consent.

00:27:30.840 --> 00:27:33.230
Same for the 2019 agreement with ringing doorbells.

00:27:34.170 --> 00:27:39.480
So why is it that we're signing promises not to talk publicly about tools

00:27:39.490 --> 00:27:40.850
that are pointed at the public?

00:27:41.930 --> 00:27:46.370
I emailed all 5 of you the information about LexisNexis back on the 9th.

00:27:47.380 --> 00:27:52.110
All I was sent back was a link to HPD's new transparency portal on Flock

00:27:52.370 --> 00:27:53.910
and had none of my questions answered.

00:27:54.890 --> 00:27:57.830
So, can we please get some information on the record?

00:27:58.370 --> 00:28:00.860
What does HPD use LexusNestis for?

00:28:01.370 --> 00:28:03.890
