00:28:51.260 --> 00:28:54.540
North Alabama Railroad Museum appreciates the city of Huntsville's continued

00:28:54.540 --> 00:28:58.450
recognition and support of railroad history and preservation to our community.

00:28:58.820 --> 00:29:00.980
For 60 years, our mission has been to preserve,

00:29:01.220 --> 00:29:05.500
protect, and share the rich railroad history of North Alabama for future

00:29:05.500 --> 00:29:06.050
