00:29:06.830 --> 00:29:11.820
As a 501c3 nonprofit organization and operated entirely by volunteers,

00:29:12.230 --> 00:29:15.430
we take great pride in the dedication and hard work that goes into preserving

00:29:15.430 --> 00:29:16.960
our region's railroad history.

00:29:17.190 --> 00:29:21.160
We recognize the historical significance of the Huntsville Depot and equipment

00:29:21.160 --> 00:29:25.220
associated with it, and we understand the strong connection of our community

00:29:25.220 --> 00:29:27.200
has to these pieces of history.

00:29:27.630 --> 00:29:30.950
We are grateful to be a part of the ongoing conversation about preserving

00:29:30.950 --> 00:29:33.370
our railroad history for generations to come.

00:29:33.830 --> 00:29:34.420
Thank you.

