00:35:58.890 --> 00:36:01.630
chambers for Connect Class 29.

00:36:02.090 --> 00:36:05.810
When, uh, when, when I was on the leadership Huntsville board and we started

00:36:05.810 --> 00:36:11.210
the Connect program, it was to create a program that would connect young

00:36:11.210 --> 00:36:13.490
professionals to each other and to our community.

00:36:13.740 --> 00:36:17.760
And that exercise today really gave them a new look at.

00:36:18.710 --> 00:36:23.110
City council governance, but also our community as a whole.

00:36:23.300 --> 00:36:27.420
The exercise involved us giving them the outside allocations,

00:36:27.430 --> 00:36:29.600
agency allocations budget.

00:36:30.030 --> 00:36:33.510
They took, were divided into groups, took on the roles of council member,

00:36:33.670 --> 00:36:37.430
mayor, and finance director, and each group looked at that budget and what

00:36:37.430 --> 00:36:37.950
would you change?

00:36:38.030 --> 00:36:38.940
What would you do different?

00:36:38.950 --> 00:36:39.820
How would you handle it?

00:36:40.300 --> 00:36:43.430
And their takeaways, I did that for like half an hour,

00:36:43.580 --> 00:36:46.910
and their takeaways were this is not as easy as it looks.

00:36:47.100 --> 00:36:48.180
You need to do your homework.

00:36:48.220 --> 00:36:49.780
You need to have background and perspective,

00:36:49.790 --> 00:36:52.500
and you need to work together and compromise to make it happen.

00:36:52.540 --> 00:36:55.460
And it was just a, a great exercise, and we look forward,

00:36:55.500 --> 00:36:56.220
we've done it now.

00:36:56.260 --> 00:36:57.580
I don't know how many years we've done it,

00:36:57.820 --> 00:37:00.590
uh, 3 years I think, and we look forward to doing it again in,

00:37:00.620 --> 00:37:01.370
in the future.

