02:27:45.360 --> 02:27:45.950
Good evening.

02:27:46.080 --> 02:27:47.360
My name is Darren.

02:27:47.590 --> 02:27:51.240
My and my contact information is correct on the sheet.

02:27:51.360 --> 02:27:53.800
My city of residence is Huntsville, Alabama.

02:27:55.030 --> 02:27:57.910
In the last 5 years, Huntsville has added 34,000 people,

02:27:58.070 --> 02:28:00.040
which is 18 new residents a day.

02:28:00.970 --> 02:28:02.490
The traffic has kept pace.

02:28:02.500 --> 02:28:08.490
On Memorial Parkway near Martin Road, we already see 5,454,000 vehicles

02:28:08.490 --> 02:28:15.130
a day, and ADOT's own long-term forecast adds about 30% to every segment

02:28:15.130 --> 02:28:17.550
of that parkway by 2045.

02:28:18.410 --> 02:28:22.650
A resident of South Huntsville heading downtown north or to Research Park

02:28:22.650 --> 02:28:25.030
has one practical choice a car.

02:28:26.160 --> 02:28:27.130
Here's my proposal.

02:28:27.480 --> 02:28:31.600
Build a greenway along the Huntsville and Madison County Railroad Authority's

02:28:31.600 --> 02:28:37.000
track running about 9 miles from Governor's Drive to Green Cove Road southeast.

02:28:37.890 --> 02:28:40.540
The design is what engineers call a rail with trail,

02:28:40.650 --> 02:28:45.320
a paved path beside the active line, not in place of it.

02:28:45.810 --> 02:28:50.810
The track is an ideal host because trains are limited to 10 to 25 MPH.

02:28:51.130 --> 02:28:53.770
And the corridor is gentle, controlled, and continuous,

02:28:53.960 --> 02:28:56.010
which is exactly what a greenway needs.

02:28:56.240 --> 02:28:58.350
The trail could be so much more.

02:28:58.600 --> 02:29:02.920
It could link the South Huntsville Loop and Aldridge Creek Greenway to the

02:29:02.920 --> 02:29:05.680
south and reach Alabama A&M to the north.

02:29:05.840 --> 02:29:09.360
But those projects all depend on a central spine,

02:29:09.680 --> 02:29:13.110
and the rail corridor runs almost straight through the middle of the city.

02:29:14.220 --> 02:29:16.130
The benefits would be hard to overstate.

02:29:16.340 --> 02:29:18.610
The trail would be quiet and comfortable to use,

02:29:18.700 --> 02:29:21.980
and it would connect residents to business centers and neighborhoods that

02:29:21.980 --> 02:29:23.530
have never had a route like this.

02:29:23.820 --> 02:29:27.930
Local businesses alongside it would see a real boost in property values

02:29:28.210 --> 02:29:30.900
near a well-used greenway consistently rise,

02:29:31.020 --> 02:29:34.420
which showed how much people value living next to one.

02:29:35.690 --> 02:29:38.130
The project is significant, but is not out of reach.

02:29:38.350 --> 02:29:43.170
Similar greenways cost between $800,000 and $2.5 million per mile,

02:29:43.370 --> 02:29:49.260
which puts 9 miles at roughly $7.2 million on the low end and $22.5 million

02:29:49.260 --> 02:29:50.120
on the high end.

02:29:50.650 --> 02:29:53.050
Against the cost of widening the parkway,

02:29:53.210 --> 02:29:54.120
that is a bargain.

02:29:54.370 --> 02:29:57.900
The trail can also be built in segments to lower the upfront cost,

02:29:58.050 --> 02:29:59.810
and maintenance would be far cheaper than the.

02:30:00.220 --> 02:30:01.260
Than for a roadway.

02:30:01.340 --> 02:30:02.880
The funding is already taking shape.

02:30:03.010 --> 02:30:06.380
The 2027 budget allocates $2 million for greenways,

02:30:06.530 --> 02:30:09.770
which would cover a substantial stretch of this trail.

02:30:10.090 --> 02:30:16.490
Meanwhile, the city plans to spend $5.5 million on downtown parking in 2027

02:30:16.490 --> 02:30:16.940
alone.

02:30:17.170 --> 02:30:20.730
Every resident who can use a greenway instead of a car reduces that kind

02:30:20.730 --> 02:30:21.810
of recurring cost.

02:30:22.140 --> 02:30:27.890
Consider what we are already spending $25 million on old Big Cove Road,

02:30:28.090 --> 02:30:29.400
$28 million on.

02:30:29.940 --> 02:30:34.030
Resolute Way and 72 million on the northern bypass.

02:30:34.260 --> 02:30:37.660
This trail would be the equivalent of adding another parkway for a fraction

02:30:37.660 --> 02:30:38.610
of those figures.

02:30:38.860 --> 02:30:41.960
If it carried even 10% of the parkway's traffic,

02:30:42.260 --> 02:30:43.680
it would be a resounding success.

02:30:44.120 --> 02:30:44.920
Thank you for your time.

02:30:45.040 --> 02:30:45.490
Thank you, sir.

