02:34:37.460 --> 02:34:42.460
My topic this evening is in asking the mayor and the council to take a very

02:34:42.460 --> 02:34:46.630
serious independent consideration of Huntsville utilities.

02:34:47.270 --> 02:34:49.200
And I have several reasons why.

02:34:50.460 --> 02:34:54.810
First, there is a growing number of customer concerns.

02:34:55.560 --> 02:34:58.720
Initially, Wes Kelly, who is the present CEO.

02:35:01.490 --> 02:35:03.100
I'm trying to think of a way to say this.

02:35:03.300 --> 02:35:10.010
We made a transition to a computer system called an NISC away from an SAP.

02:35:10.890 --> 02:35:14.730
The SAP computer system keeps separate profit centers gas,

02:35:14.810 --> 02:35:16.050
water, electric, and fiber.

02:35:18.180 --> 02:35:21.530
In order to merge the fiber and the electric,

02:35:21.900 --> 02:35:25.190
it would be impossible with the SAP, so you would have to make the conversion

02:35:25.190 --> 02:35:26.530
with an NISC.

02:35:27.020 --> 02:35:31.410
The problem with the NISC is that there have been so many errors,

02:35:31.740 --> 02:35:36.660
as I previously presented with one customer who got a $6700 bill that was

02:35:36.660 --> 02:35:37.880
not even in her name.

02:35:39.080 --> 02:35:42.440
That has never been brought back by Huntsville utilities.

02:35:42.520 --> 02:35:43.280
However, Mr.

02:35:43.370 --> 02:35:48.780
Kelly comes in every year when there are requests about increased rates.

02:35:49.820 --> 02:35:53.240
Now Fox 54 presents the AMI.

02:35:53.580 --> 02:35:55.180
The AMI was around before Mr.

02:35:55.600 --> 02:35:55.780
Mr.

02:35:55.860 --> 02:36:00.900
Kelly actually came into office, but now they are asking the citizens to

02:36:00.900 --> 02:36:04.740
be able to pay a fee in order to opt out when we never asked to opt in.

02:36:05.530 --> 02:36:09.760
And under the present contracts with TVA I understand that there's a contract

02:36:09.760 --> 02:36:13.800
there and of course, uh, we want their business and they want ours.

02:36:14.410 --> 02:36:19.200
But what Huntsville Utilities has not done is been fair with the differential

02:36:19.210 --> 02:36:23.890
rate or in or in creating a differential rate when it came to fiber that

02:36:23.890 --> 02:36:26.290
was not in the areas of Meridianville, Hazel Green,

02:36:26.410 --> 02:36:27.480
or in New Market.

02:36:28.470 --> 02:36:31.390
So when the council starts to elect these board members,

02:36:31.510 --> 02:36:34.660
one of my key questions is, #1, are they qualified?

02:36:34.870 --> 02:36:36.210
Is it about friendship?

02:36:36.750 --> 02:36:38.230
Is it about politics?

02:36:38.600 --> 02:36:41.900
Are they able to calculate a cubic foot into gallons?

02:36:42.840 --> 02:36:47.470
Do you understand what a 11 CCF calculates into?

02:36:48.010 --> 02:36:49.240
Do you multiply it by 10?

02:36:49.290 --> 02:36:50.960
Do you multiply it by 100?

02:36:51.520 --> 02:36:53.920
What are the concerns when Mr.

02:36:54.010 --> 02:36:56.430
Kelly comes in about the increased rates?

02:36:56.710 --> 02:36:59.690
Is he letting the board know prior to the decisions,

02:36:59.880 --> 02:37:03.520
or is it after, or is it essentially being rubber stamped?

02:37:04.000 --> 02:37:08.650
I think that it is time for much greater transparency and accountability.

02:37:09.310 --> 02:37:13.760
People are working hard and if nothing else that we have seen in this year

02:37:14.100 --> 02:37:18.950
for America is it's really not about what your political party is it's really

02:37:18.950 --> 02:37:22.630
about accountability and transparency and we've seen that change even in

02:37:22.630 --> 02:37:24.510
Madison County that turned blue.

02:37:24.960 --> 02:37:28.320
But one more thing I wanted to mention was the Tesla battery.

02:37:28.440 --> 02:37:31.440
What about the connection there in the engineering departments?

02:37:31.480 --> 02:37:34.150
Did they consider that when it was close to Vulcan,

02:37:34.280 --> 02:37:36.800
where they actually blow up rock with dynamite?

02:37:37.040 --> 02:37:37.920
And I thank you.

02:37:38.120 --> 02:37:39.280
Thank you, Doctor Somerset.

